1
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Ascending the West Tower of Fanlou

2
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,640
is not something I, Meng, can do.

3
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:13,800
I want to make a deal.

4
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,680
Please speak, Meng.

5
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:18,240
On the night of the Lantern Festival in three days,

6
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:20,320
you must leave three days' worth of medicine

7
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,240
for me.

8
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:22,560
How can we

9
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,760
trust you?

10
00:01:24,039 --> 00:01:24,920
If you don't,

11
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:27,320
I will report to the authorities.

12
00:01:27,320 --> 00:01:28,250
You are bandits,

13
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:29,840
and I know Dongjing like the back of my hand.

14
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,170
When you need to escape,

15
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,259
you can come find me again.

16
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:37,039
You have guts.

17
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:39,060
How do we ascend the tower?

18
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,920
I'm all ears.

19
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,360
Things I can't do,

20
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,640
I simply can't do.

21
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:52,640
You!

22
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:54,960
But I can take you to someone who can.

23
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,140
The place we're going,

24
00:01:58,080 --> 00:02:00,010
only I, Meng Qian, can lead the way.

25
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:02,320
Are you talking about

26
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,120
Wuyou City?

27
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:11,960
Rumor has it that Wuyou City is full of

28
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:14,640
outlaws and eccentrics.

29
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,960
As long as you can afford the price,

30
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:19,960
any request will be fulfilled.

31
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,450
You've heard of it too, Taoist.

32
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:23,680
To tell you the truth,

33
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:25,920
I have indeed heard of it.

34
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:27,960
But this place is mysterious.

35
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,680
Ordinary people can't find it.

36
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,360
The Lantern Festival is approaching.

37
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:33,890
We have no choice but to come to you, Meng Qian.

38
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:36,250
We hope you can help us with all your might.

39
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,400
Since you all know it,

40
00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:40,440
you should also know that

41
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:42,280
those who enter this city

42
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:44,210
will face near-certain death.

43
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:47,650
Have you all made up your minds?

44
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:48,720
Why the nonsense?

45
00:02:49,079 --> 00:02:50,520
If we were to back down,

46
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:53,079
we wouldn't have come to Dongjing City.

47
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:59,200
This Wuyou City is indeed as rumors say.

48
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,480
Day and night are reversed,

49
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:02,740
and yin and yang are indistinguishable.

50
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,640
The compass is useless here.

51
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:08,800
Everyone, proceed with caution.

52
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,860
Have you been here?

53
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,330
I've only been this far.

54
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:13,200
Every step forward is new.

55
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:35,700
Pre-Qin ancient city.

56
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:36,579
I didn't expect

57
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:37,840
it to actually exist.

58
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:46,730
The direction of the miasma ahead is unclear.

59
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,240
We will wait for Brother Li Lang to return from scouting

60
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,640
before making any plans.

61
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:53,200
This Wuyou City has this miasma as a barrier.

62
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:56,400
No wonder the imperial soldiers have never set foot here.

63
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:12,040
My lord.

64
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:14,160
Did you see the situation inside the courtyard?

65
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:14,760
Not yet.

66
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,079
I only saw the person leading the horse enter the courtyard.

67
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:17,839
However,

68
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,610
the saddle on the horse is missing.

69
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:27,340
My lord.

70
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,200
I'll go in.

71
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,660
I am the best scout.

72
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:33,720
My Lord.

73
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:34,760
Xiao Wu, he...

74
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,080
Xiao Wu's Wall Gecko skill

75
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:40,480
is at 70% of his late brother's level.

76
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,080
Xiao Wu.

77
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,640
Commander Chu.

78
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:17,680
Xiao Wu.

79
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:20,640
Xiao Wu.

80
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:24,080
Search!

81
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,920
Good thing Brother Li Lang scouted ahead.

82
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,760
Otherwise, if we jumped into the miasma,

83
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,120
our flesh and skin

84
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,200
would have rotted into pus by now.

85
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,530
I risked my life just now

86
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,960
and barely managed to cross the miasma.

87
00:05:38,960 --> 00:05:40,080
But you two brothers

88
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:41,940
and this brother probably can't.

89
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,000
I

90
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,840
actually have a way.

91
00:05:54,159 --> 00:05:55,420
Everyone, be careful.

92
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:57,520
Man or ghost?

93
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,800
Man.

94
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,480
I am Zhu Zitong.

95
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:07,080
My respects to you all.

96
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:10,800
You came from the surface.

97
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,880
Have you seen

98
00:06:13,280 --> 00:06:15,160
my daughter?

99
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:19,440
I have an only daughter,

100
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:22,130
who was abducted since childhood.

101
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:23,720
She was only

102
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,080
this big.

103
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:31,520
When her cruel mother came to find me,

104
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:34,320
she threw the baby daughter at me

105
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:37,240
and disappeared without a trace.

106
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,480
Later,

107
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,200
I watched her

108
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:43,840
grow up little by little.

109
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:48,680
She used to pull my beard,

110
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:52,840
and the white hairs that grew day by day,

111
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:56,680
to trade for malt sugar for me.

112
00:06:57,200 --> 00:07:00,060
She had only eaten two of the ten pieces of malt sugar

113
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:04,480
when I watched helplessly as she was abducted.

114
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,080
Young man,

115
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:10,500
you know where my daughter is, right?

116
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:11,880
Tell me now!

117
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,440
Tell me!

118
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,920
This miasma is indeed powerful.

119
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:29,360
Daoist.

120
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:32,380
You know where my daughter is.

121
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,770
You can help me find her, right?

122
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,400
Brother,

123
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:39,820
seeing your extraordinary skills just now,

124
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:42,120
I haven't asked you

125
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,880
how I should address you.

126
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,250
I am but a humble man.

127
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:47,159
I hold a bright lantern

128
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,640
here to guide those

129
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,730
who intend to enter Wuyou City.

130
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:53,680
I lead the way.

131
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,000
Just call me

132
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,040
the Lantern Bearer.

133
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:58,960
The Lantern Bearer.

134
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,000
Old man,

135
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,520
since you can freely pass through this fog,

136
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:04,840
why not enter the city to find her yourself?

137
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:06,280
Of course I have.

138
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,880
But the Master of Wuyou Cave

139
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:11,100
won't accept my business.

140
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:15,440
I can only guide those entering and leaving Wuyou City,

141
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:17,160
praying that someone

142
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:20,000
can help me find my daughter.

143
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,520
But those who promised to help

144
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:25,440
never kept their word.

145
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:26,760
I hate them!

146
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,280
I hate them so much!

147
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:30,200
The Lantern Bearer can enter Wuyou City,

148
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:31,680
which already shows great skill.

149
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:34,340
It seems this Master of Wuyou Cave is not simple.

150
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:35,400
Everyone,

151
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,760
are you willing to help me find my daughter?

152
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:42,280
Brother,

153
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:43,520
I am truly sorry.

154
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,360
We have urgent matters to attend to,

155
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:48,800
so I'm afraid we can't help you.

156
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,200
Without me,

157
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,160
how will you pass through this miasma?

158
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:53,680
I have my own ways,

159
00:08:53,760 --> 00:08:56,360
so don't you worry about it.

160
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,960
Although this miasma is poisonous,

161
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:00,920
fortunately,

162
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:05,080
I brought miasma-repelling pills.

163
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,520
Take this,

164
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,380
keep it under your tongue.

165
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:12,280
Do not swallow it.

166
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:14,240
My daughter!

167
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:17,960
How can I find you?

168
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:20,000
My daughter!

169
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:21,960
Old man.

170
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:23,240
Once I enter the city,

171
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,320
if there is a chance,

172
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:27,520
I will definitely ask about your daughter's whereabouts.

173
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:28,320
Young man,

174
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:32,920
why are you helping me?

175
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:36,200
I'll kill you!

176
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:36,640
My lord!

177
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,200
My lord!

178
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,320
I will kill you!

179
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:40,720
Officer,

180
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,240
have mercy!

181
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:42,700
My lord,

182
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:45,200
focus on the big picture!

183
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:45,800
My lord,

184
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,280
what are you saying?

185
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:48,720
Xiaowu,

186
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,800
I really don't know who he is.

187
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,280
I couldn't possibly have killed him.

188
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:53,240
Tell the truth.

189
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,160
I am

190
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:55,120
Liu Heizi,

191
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,440
from Dongjing.

192
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,240
What is your relationship with them?

193
00:09:58,240 --> 00:10:00,520
What relationship could I have with them?

194
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:02,520
I'm just a lowly idler.

195
00:10:02,520 --> 00:10:04,120
I happened to take a job

196
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,650
to deliver some goods here.

197
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:07,800
What are they doing here?

198
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,000
Do you know?

199
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:09,440
I...

200
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,120
I...

201
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,920
I don't know.

202
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:14,240
They

203
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,360
are all mutes.

204
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:17,000
I am telling the truth.

205
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:20,120
If you don't believe me, you can send someone to check.

206
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:21,200
Got it.

207
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:28,040
If you dare to lie,

208
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,640
I'll stab you.

209
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:32,600
My Lord.

210
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:37,600
After him!

211
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:38,640
Yes.

212
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,560
Stop running! Stop!

213
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:44,800
Take him down!

214
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:45,600
Don't run!

215
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,320
Wait.

216
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:48,240
Under this well is Wuyou City,

217
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:50,170
which connects to the underworld.

218
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:51,320
If you have the guts,

219
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,520
then follow me.

220
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:00,880
Lord Duzhi.

221
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:02,880
There are too many forks down this well.

222
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:03,810
If we go too deep,

223
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,440
I'm afraid we won't catch Liu Heizi,

224
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:07,500
and we might trap ourselves instead.

225
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:11,120
A human's nose is never as sensitive as a dog's.

226
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,760
You are right, Lord Duzhi.
